{"id":"n1fd9b595ee","headline":"Good news for diabetes & BP patients: Govt cuts prices of these 30 medicines, relief may reach pharmacies soon","summary":"India's National Pharmaceutical Pricing Authority has fixed retail prices for 30 essential drug formulations, including those for diabetes, heart disease and infections. Benefits are expected to reach consumers in two to three months.","why":"The NPPA is India's drug price regulator, which caps prices on essential medicines under the Drugs Prices Control Order. Its decisions directly affect pharmaceutical company revenues in the domestic market.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/new-updates/good-news-for-diabetes-bp-patients-govt-cuts-prices-of-these-30-medicines-relief-may-reach-pharmacies-soon/articleshow/131441135.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/new-updates/good-news-for-diabetes-bp-patients-govt-cuts-prices-of-these-30-medicines-relief-may-reach-pharmacies-soon/articleshow/131441135.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-06-01T11:18:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T15:20:22Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"29077828bc0ac972","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T15:20:22Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-01T11:18:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-01T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/pharmaceutical-laboratory-3887443.jpg","alt":"pharmaceutical laboratory (illustration)","credit":"HeungSoon","license":"Pixabay Content Licens